Not covered by this license

This license covers the code of Class Markers (plugin/, tools/, the .bat files)
and its documentation. The plugin reads art and text from ELDEN RING and The
Convergence while the game runs; none of it is included here. It does not
cover the data in plugin/src/generated.rs that is derived from The
Convergence's files (item and note ids, positions, event flags, class names),
which is included only so the mod works with it.

ELDEN RING is a trademark of FromSoftware / Bandai Namco. The Convergence is
made by The Convergence team. Class Markers is a fan project, not affiliated
with either.
